'''Hayabusa''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]] gains [[Zombie Killer]] and targets [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]] and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]].

